# Arm vLLM's built-in repetition detector (SamplingParams.repetition_detection)
# for requests that do not set one. GLM-5.3-Flash can degrade into repetition
# loops in long tool-calling sessions (vllm#54337) and a looping request holds
# a --max-num-seqs slot until max_tokens or the context limit. Default: a
# >=4-token pattern repeated 16x, patterns up to 64 tokens. Container env
# TINFOIL_REPETITION_DETECTION="max,min,count" overrides; "0" disables.
